  "description": "Fody IL weaver that instruments every .NET method at compile time for production code coverage. Injects a lightweight Hit() call (~4 ns overhead) into each method body and generates a module initializer to register metadata (class, method, file, line) with the shared runtime registry. Exports coverage_method_hit and coverage_method_calls_total to Prometheus / Mimir via OpenTelemetry — no agent, no profiler. Add to every project you want to instrument; pair with BlazorAmpowering.Coverage.Runtime in the entry project.",
  "id": "BlazorAmpowering.Coverage",
